WEBVTT

00:00:00.550 --> 00:00:04.420
Families: find a family and see everything about it.

00:00:05.270 --> 00:00:07.169
Search by any name or email,

00:00:07.369 --> 00:00:09.490
and open the family.

00:00:10.340 --> 00:00:16.186
Email sign-in link resends their link. Open as this family shows exactly what they see.

00:00:16.386 --> 00:00:21.443
Each person is listed. With background checks on, set each adult's status here.

00:00:21.643 --> 00:00:24.000
Their shifts are at the bottom.

00:00:24.850 --> 00:00:32.200
Review lists families who set themselves up, and possible duplicates, like a student already on another family.

00:00:33.050 --> 00:00:35.700
Next: who's short.
